  "script": "Starting at a whopping $194,000, the 2023 Range Rover P530 SV blends luxury and power like no other. Rooted in Range Rover's iconic design language, this model continues a legacy of sophistication. It's styled to impress with sleeker lines and a bold presence. Under the hood, it packs a 4.4-liter twin-turbo V8 delivering 523 horsepower, sourced from BMW, offering smooth, powerful acceleration. The P530's all-wheel drive offers superior handling on any terrain. It's a perfect match for both city streets and rugged trails. With its powerful engine, it stands against the BMW X5 M\u2019s 600 horsepower. Still, Range Rover's elegance often wins over in luxury. Inside, opulence abounds with plush leather, real wood, and the latest tech\u2014creating an exquisite driving environment. So, when choosing between raw power and unmatched luxury, which SUV would you take home?",
